-| `strong`             | Higher contrast and/or elevated emphasis.   |
+| Value                | Description                                     |
+| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
+| `strong`             | Higher contrast and/or elevated emphasis.       |
 | `weak`               | Subtle variant for secondary or muted elements. |
 
 **State** represents the interactive state of the element, if specified. The default is an idle state.
